{
  "notes": "Ambient, C# phrygian, 52 BPM: the slowest World. A sine sub holds the floor, a nebula of granular strings (GRAIN on the STRGS set) breathes the chords in open fifths, the player's distant choir swells in slowly on the Smart Keys (minor pentatonic: no b2, so any key is safe), and a tribal heartbeat sounds far away once every two bars. The harmony barely moves: A is one chord for eight bars over the C# pedal, B turns to the phrygian II (D major 7) and back every four bars, C lifts through the major chords of the mode (VI, II, III) two bars each, D sinks to iv over the C# pedal and home. No 9th voicings on i (the minor 9th of phrygian). All material is original.",
